<view class="page">
  <view class="hub-grid">
    <view class="mt-card" wx:if="{{!isProperty}}" bindtap="goCommittee">
      <view class="mt-icon" style="background:#FFF3DC;">📅</view>
      <text class="mt-title">业主委员会</text>
      <text class="mt-desc">例会管理 · 三阶段跟踪</text>
      <text class="mt-badge">{{counts.committeeActive}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="mt-card" bindtap="goReception">
      <view class="mt-icon" style="background:#EBF8F2;">📝</view>
      <text class="mt-title">接待记录</text>
      <text class="mt-desc">来访接待登记</text>
      <text class="mt-badge" style="background:#2ECC71;">{{counts.receptionPending}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="mt-card" bindtap="goLearning">
      <view class="mt-icon" style="background:#F5EEF8;">📖</view>
      <text class="mt-title">业务学习</text>
      <text class="mt-desc">培训学习记录</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="hub-tip">
    <text>💡 提示：会议新建、开始与结束由主任/副主任操作；记录员负责送达、佐证与留痕；委员可查看本人相关会议。</text>
  </view>
</view>
